<h1>About QuixCalc</h1>

<section class="tool" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <h2>Our Core Mission</h2>
    <p>Welcome to QuixCalc where we believe that everyday mathematical and developer tasks should be solved instantly. Our dedicated team of engineers started this project after constantly struggling to find clean ad free and private tools on the current internet. We grew tired of web applications that force you to create accounts watch video advertisements or upload sensitive data to completely unknown servers.</p>
    <p>We built this website with three uncompromisable pillars in mind. First every tool must operate with blazing speed. Second the user interface must remain absolutely clean and intuitive. Finally user privacy must remain paramount at all times. By processing everything strictly using your own local browser technology we ensure your data never leaves your personal device.</p>

    <h2>The Engineering Team</h2>
    <p>We are a small collective of web developers designers and math enthusiasts scattered across the globe. Some of us specialize in cryptographically secure randomization algorithms while others obsess over interface design and user experience. We actively collaborate to build applications that we actually want to use ourselves every single day.</p>

    <h2>How We Keep Things Free</h2>
    <p>Developing hosting and maintaining a high quality platform requires significant resources. To keep everything completely free for students developers and casual users we utilize a highly selective native advertising program. We explicitly avoid popup windows video overlays and malicious tracking scripts. Our non intrusive display partnerships simply cover our server costs allowing us to focus entirely on building great new features.</p>
    
    <h2>Looking Forward</h2>
    <p>Our initial release features twenty highly optimized calculators and text formatters. We are already researching and developing the next wave of advanced mathematical utilities which will launch later this year. We genuinely hope our tools save you time and make your daily digital workflow significantly easier.</p>
</section>
